{"id":"140f19e2806d749f","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-interpretability-transitivity.md","title":"Reflexivity and Transitivity","display":"thm-interpretability-transitivity — Reflexivity and Transitivity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-interpretability-transitivity","aliases":["67-thm-interpretability-transitivity"],"display":"thm-interpretability-transitivity — Reflexivity and Transitivity","depends_on":["[[67-df-interpretability]]","[[67-df-translation]]","[[67-df-relative-interpretation]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 76；PDF 第 87 页；第 7 章开头印刷页 94，PDF 第 105 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"原书只要求读者检查；已给出本地复合域与函数图论证，未机器形式化","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-interpretability-transitivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-interpretability-transitivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-interpretability-transitivity — Reflexivity and Transitivity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" href=\"?note=ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" title=\"67-df-translation\">67-df-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95924098a9c5f575\" href=\"?note=95924098a9c5f575\" title=\"67-df-relative-interpretation\">67-df-relative-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 76；PDF 第 87 页；第 7 章开头印刷页 94，PDF 第 105 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"原书只要求读者检查；已给出本地复合域与函数图论证，未机器形式化"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(R,S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是算术公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。</li>\n<li>翻译使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" href=\"?note=ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" title=\"67-df-translation\">67-df-translation</a> 的固定规范化和无捕获代入，合法域及函数图条件取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"95924098a9c5f575\" href=\"?note=95924098a9c5f575\" title=\"67-df-relative-interpretation\">67-df-relative-interpretation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R\\unlhd R,\n\\qquad\n(R\\unlhd S\\land S\\unlhd T)\\Longrightarrow R\\unlhd T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R\\unlhd R,\n\\qquad\n(R\\unlhd S\\land S\\unlhd T)\\Longrightarrow R\\unlhd T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反身性由全域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(x)=(x=x)\">\\(\\mu(x)=(x=x)\\)</span> 与原算术符号的恒等解释给出，规范化最多改变逻辑等价的写法。</p>\n<p>传递性需复合相对解释数据，不能只把两个未经修正的公式函数作逐字复合：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_t\">\\(\\mu_t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_u\">\\(\\mu_u\\)</span>，复合域取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_u(x)\\land u(\\mu_t(x))\">\\(\\mu_u(x)\\land u(\\mu_t(x))\\)</span>，原子函数图按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 翻译 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的函数图。目标证明域非空与运算全函数性，结构归纳给出句子翻译与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(t(\\varphi))\">\\(u(t(\\varphi))\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中等价，因此保持定理。</p>\n<p>原书第 76 页要求读者验证传递性，第 94 页明确重述反身、传递。这里记录本地复合论证；未把读者练习标成原书给出了完整证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §1，印刷页 76；PDF 第 87 页；第 7 章开头印刷页 94，PDF 第 105 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：原书只要求读者检查；已给出本地复合域与函数图论证，未机器形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-translation","status":"resolved","id":"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"95924098a9c5f575","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-relative-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R,S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是算术公理集，$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-translation","status":"resolved","id":"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"翻译使用 [[67-df-translation]] 的固定规范化和无捕获代入，合法域及函数图条件取 [[67-df-relative-interpretation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"95924098a9c5f575","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"翻译使用 [[67-df-translation]] 的固定规范化和无捕获代入，合法域及函数图条件取 [[67-df-relative-interpretation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd","display":false},{"tex":"R\\unlhd R,\n\\qquad\n(R\\unlhd S\\land S\\unlhd T)\\Longrightarrow R\\unlhd T.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu(x)=(x=x)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_t","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_u(x)\\land u(\\mu_t(x))","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"u(t(\\varphi))","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2093,"backlinks":[{"id":"89eac554f6aa8842","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"可解释性复合的传递性见 [[67-thm-interpretability-transitivity]]；等价类及序均按上述构造。"},{"id":"2e898bc916d99192","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-interpretability-transitivity]]"}],"outgoing":["44cd21d3d12e4d8d","ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","95924098a9c5f575"]}